                  <th>#</th>
                  <th>Run settings</th>
                  <th>Mean (equator)</th>
                  <th>Mean (global)</th>
                  <th>Diviner-fit mean (equator)</th>
                  <th>Difference (model − NASA)</th>
                  <th>Hottest (equator)</th>
                  <th>Coldest (equator)</th>
                </tr>
